                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">REVIEW
Stage controls preview only. RUN buttons launch calculation.
Case 1=SLS; 2=ULS snow; 3/4=unbalanced snow; 5=uplift.
Field 0: FEM von Mises / optimization density.
For stress comparisons use Field=2 and common maximum=60 MPa.
Optimization stress is relaxed; only final verification recalculates the binary part.
Set deformation factor=100 only for display, then return to 0 before inspecting geometry.</item>
